 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+## API
+
+- `resolvePointer(document, pointer)`: JSON Pointer (RFC 6901). Returns the value the pointer refers to;
+  throws `JsonPointerError` if the pointer is invalid (§3) or does not resolve to a value (§4, including
+  the `-` array token). Only own members are followed; the document is not modified. The URI fragment
+  form (§6) is not supported.
