+# Plan: JSON Pointer resolution
+Spec: specs/001-json-pointer/spec.md. Standard: RFC 6901 §3, §4, §5.
+
+## Design
+`src/pointer.ts` holds `JsonPointerError` and `resolvePointer`; `src/index.ts` re-exports them. Pure function: split on `/`, decode `~1` then `~0`, walk with own-property checks; arrays accept `0|[1-9][0-9]*` within range.
+
+## Constitution Check
+- I: standard and sections named; rules implemented exactly. PASS
+- II: no dependencies. PASS
+- III: tests in `test/pointer.test.ts` written first. PASS
+- IV: no mutation, own-property only, typed error. PASS
+- V: strict TS, doc comments, exported from index. PASS
+- VI: single small module. PASS
